        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Acquisitions and press by inquiry",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Presented at Carnegie Hall · Coral Gables Museum · COP30",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "\"I define impact art not as a genre but as a methodology one that recognizes aesthetic production as inseparable from ecological and cultural consequence.\"",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "EDUCATION + PUBLIC SPEAKING",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "Bringing awareness to issues and solutions surrounding vanishing eco-systems and biodiversity",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Shining light on opportunities to live in a more synergistic and flourishing world, Ekaterina is a passionate speaker and spokesperson.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "ACTIVATING THE LIFE FORCE OF OUR PLANET",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "Rainforests are the beating heart and lungs of the earth",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Project designed to support the longevity and vitality of our planet.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "\"Developing my relationship with the Divine inspires my creativity.\"",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Cultivating a deeper connection with spirituality has enriched my life and my creativity. Vows of silence are an integral practice that keeps me connected with my mission as an artist.",
